# GM-48 timeout smoke. Run scripts/gm48_hosted_tick_check.py to build the
# two-user fixture, assert the wait transition, and replay the original ACK.
# These requests use synthetic fixtures and normal users. No admin key is needed.
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:55481
@publicKey = REPLACE_WITH_QA_PUBLIC_KEY
@hostToken = REPLACE_WITH_QA_HOST_JWT
@roomId = REPLACE_WITH_TEST_ROOM_UUID

### Verify waiting before the 60-second deadline, then the terminal snapshot after it
POST {{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/rpc/dish_session
apikey: {{publicKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"command":"snapshot","payload":{"contractVersion":"dish-session-v4/roadmap-v2/GM-07.B-supplement","roomId":"{{roomId}}"}}

### After server tick, HTTP 200 and data.status DECIDED with one submitted ballot
POST {{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/rpc/dish_session
apikey: {{publicKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"command":"result","payload":{"contractVersion":"dish-session-v4/roadmap-v2/GM-07.B-supplement","roomId":"{{roomId}}"}}
